WEBVTT

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.500
Maeda, perfect timing!

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.080
What do you mean?

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.460
You see, the girls are in the pool right now.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:32.220
It's the perfect chance to gaze at the Wife of the Academy, Yunoki Rina, in her swimsuit!

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.590
Hey, hold up!

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.430
We're seriously sorry about that, man!

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.280
This time will be a little different, though.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.900
"This time"?

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.420
We're giving it another shot.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.210
We'll get glimpse shots of those Rinaboobs or die trying!

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.570
You haven't learned your lesson?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:54.750
I <i>said</i> it's going to be a bit different.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:58.640
We've cooked up a special move that takes advantage of my powers!

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.330
Behold the fruits of our training!

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:02.950
Training?

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.330
Catapult!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.460
Ready...

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.080
Go!

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.260
Combination Glimpse Shot!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:19.350
Itta On!

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:25.310
Camera Fusion! Super High Angler!

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:26.640
DX Fusion

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.900
Marvel at this awesomeness!

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.570
Now we can shoot from over the fence!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.280
We're getting that Rinaboob shot!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.060
Let's go, Azuma!

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:39.200
To our paradise!

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.460
But how will we get there?

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.010
Ain't gonna work.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:36.230
Do you know the one they call "The Wife of the Academy"?

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.240
She's beautiful, her kindness seemingly knows no bounds,

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.240
and she has an amazing body.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:47.700
This is the Cooking Research Society where you can cook with the Wife of the Academy, Yunoki Rina!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:51.500
Come join us!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.410
No, it's all wrong!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:04:00.500
I'm supposed to be advertising the
Cooking Research Society, not Yunoki-san!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.890
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.640
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:22.420
<i>That's what happened when I noticed a wonderful aroma wafting from the home econ room.</i>

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.410
Oh, it's Yunoki-san.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:37.790
A new recipe?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.030
Yeah.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:43.230
I'm trying to come up with a new dish to present at the cultural festival.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:45.540
Go ahead and eat it!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:46.500
Thanks.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.760
But are you sure?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.000
I'm just some passerby, so I probably shouldn't...

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.590
It's fine, it's fine.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:55.740
I'm the only one in the club, after all.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:58.650
I'm glad you came in when you did!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.040
Oh, okay.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:05.360
I wish we had more members, though.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.400
Delicious!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.860
This is delicious, Yunoki-san!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.740
Really?

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.450
That's good.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.120
These'll definitely sell at the festival!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.590
You might even get some new members.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:20.580
I... hope so.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:28.880
You see, if I don't get at least four more
members before the cultural festival ends,

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.930
the club will be disbanded.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.030
What?!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:35.430
But there's only one month left until the festival.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:37.050
Right.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:40.120
So I tried making a poster,

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.510
but it didn't help very much.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.900
Yeah, it doesn't really stand out.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.720
Maybe something fancier would work better.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.950
Fancier?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.320
Oh, I know! Photos!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.700
Add photos to it!

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:58.540
Huh?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.100
Let's put photos of your cooking on it!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.640
It'll make for a great advertisement!

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.630
Yeah, you're right! That just might work!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:07.800
Can I count on you?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.050
Sure.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.820
Could we do it some other time, though?

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:14.060
I need to learn how to take pictures of food.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.190
I see.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:20.230
Then I'll keep working at coming up with a new dish for the cultural festival!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:23.440
Could you take a picture of it when I do?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.460
Of course!

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:28.450
Well, I guess we've both got work to do before then!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.330
Yeah!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:35.950
<i>And so, I took on the task of making a poster.</i>

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:40.210
<i>But there was little improvement in my skills by the time fall rolled around.</i>

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.500
M-Maeda!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.480
Save us, Maeda!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.650
They're all yours!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.160
They <i>still</i> haven't learned their lesson?

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.380
Hold it, Photography Club!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.260
Yes?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.510
So <i>you're</i> the one who tried to sneak into the vaulting horse?

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.610
Huh?!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.140
No, no way!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.520
You've got the wrong guy!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.300
You lie!

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.680
I've seen you wandering around here with that camera recently!

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.740
That's because the Rhythmic Gymnastics Club—

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.910
What?! Take this!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.850
Ow...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.390
Freakin' Nakagawa and Azuma...

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.800
I'd better explain myself.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.070
<i>What's she doing?</i>

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.830
Bend!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.360
Whoa!

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.960
A photo opportunity?!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.340
Huh?

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:12.040
Yunoki-san, were you trying to bend that spoon?

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.280
Maeda-kun? Did you just take a photo?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:15.930
Yeah.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.300
Let's get one more!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.450
What?! No way!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.480
Don't take that kind of picture of me!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.740
So you're into ESP and stuff like that?

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.080
No!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:29.180
I was just bored because there aren't any other members!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.990
This is so embarrassing.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:39.830
Um...

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:42.830
Don't worry about what happened earlier today.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.000
Huh?

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.480
I know it was all a misunderstanding.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.250
I explained the situation to everyone.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:53.100
I told them you aren't the type of person to do that.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.470
Yunoki-san...

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:57.600
How could I ever repay you?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:03.100
Well, could you help me with a little something?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:03.780
Huh?

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:10.380
I'd like to have a four-leaf clover as a garnish for my dish.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.480
They're harder to find than I thought.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.770
Yeah.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.590
Do you think everyone already picked all of them because they're supposed to grant wishes?

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.500
Maybe...

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:32.840
Oh, I found one!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.380
Ow!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.460
Y-You okay?

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:43.460
Pain, pain, go away!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.100
It didn't work.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.580
I don't think that works on yourself.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.480
Oh, right.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:53.480
Here.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.150
Huh?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:57.660
U-Uh...

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.410
Pain, pain, go away!

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.670
Oh, hey!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.100
Aren't you always by yourself?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.810
If you're free, why don't we cook together?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.060
Yunoki-san, who are you talking to?

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.690
The girl over there.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:26.880
Uchida?!

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.100
How long have you been there?!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.810
My stealth... doesn't work?

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.500
Do you know her?

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.340
She's a freshman in the Photography Club.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.790
Oh, really?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.450
Then please do come and cook with us!

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.700
It'd be better if you left me alone.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.940
Why?

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.330
Isn't it boring by yourself?

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:54.930
The Wife of the Academy can see through my stealth skills!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.640
Unexpected.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.220
Complete defeat.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.120
Okay, Uchida-san.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.600
Let's get cooking!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.310
I'll help.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.060
And it's done!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.820
Yay!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.570
I call it "The Fortune Shortcake"!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:38.690
Niiyan.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:41.180
Niiyan!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.340
Niiyan, dinner's ready!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.050
How many times do I—

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:46.680
Huh?

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.930
You bought a ready-made meal?!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.860
I'm trying to figure out how to
make food look good on camera.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.020
Maeda-kun.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.720
What are you taking pictures of?

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.920
The sunflowers.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:42.590
Huh?

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.080
Never mind.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.030
How's your new dish coming along, Yunoki-san?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.060
It's not going very well.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.340
I came outside for a change of pace.

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.450
I see.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:56.360
We just need a picture of my new dish.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.460
Gotta keep trying!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.140
Um...

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.590
If you're looking for a change of pace...

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.150
I wonder what's taking Yunoki-san.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.220
Guess who!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:19.680
Yunoki-san?

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.740
No, these hands are too small...

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.860
Uh...

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.940
Bzzt! Out of time!

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.210
Do I even know you?!

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:30.400
Come on, let's go to the amusement park!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.490
Erina!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:35.040
Geez, I told you not to run!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.000
Yunoki-san?

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.180
I'm so sorry. She's my sister.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:43.120
I told her I was going to the amusement park, so she insisted on coming along.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.720
Oh, I see.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.680
I'm going to the amusement park too!

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.410
I'm really sorry.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.680
Would you mind if my sister came with us?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.320
Would you mind?

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.350
No, not at all.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.680
I have a sister too, so I understand.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.190
They always want to tag along.

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.940
It'll be like having a new sister. Should be fun.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:04.940
Something wrong?

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:07.440
No.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.700
Come on, come on!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.980
I'm scared!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.260
Wow!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.130
Dandy Stones'

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.130
Treasure

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.130
Come on, come on!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.130
Wow!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.140
It's Pretty Rabbie!

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.440
Cute, isn't it?

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.070
Ooh, it's Rabbie-chan!

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:37.260
Now, now. Where are your manners?

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.760
Yummy!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.530
Thanks for lunch!

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:44.360
Come on, let's eat.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.610
Here. Open wide.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.610
Open wide!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.580
Come on, eat up!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:52.430
Huh?

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.640
Maeda-kun?

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:58.540
You'd make a great wife someday, Yunoki-san.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.400
Huh?

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:04.120
Uh... No, sorry, don't read into it too deeply.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:07.100
Both of you are blushing so much!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.130
Just like newlyweds!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.390
Newlyweds, huh?

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.050
She fell asleep?

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:18.970
Yeah.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.400
Looks like Erina really likes you.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.030
Looks like it.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:28.650
Rina, lunch was amazing.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:35.410
I'm glad you enjoyed it, dear.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.660
I liked the presentation of it, too.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.500
Yeah!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.700
Presentation?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:51.070
I think I have an idea!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.340
You mean for the new dish?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.330
Yeah!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:57.180
I'm so glad you're around, Maeda-kun!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.080
I didn't do anything...

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:08.840
The student council president
told me when I formed the club...

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.740
Then there's the number of members.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.690
Work hard on getting new people to join.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:22.180
It would be wonderful if the students' recipes could be passed on through the generations.

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:31.140
To be honest, I didn't mind being the only member of the club.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:34.470
I thought that even if the club were to disband this year, I'd just accept it.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.900
Yunoki-san...

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:43.250
But spending time with you and brainstorming about what dishes people would like

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.330
got me thinking about other things too.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.690
Maeda-kun, I want this club to survive.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.450
I want others to learn how fun it is to cook.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.350
Yeah.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.840
Let's keep it alive.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.750
This is a notice from the Student Council.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.300
Today is the deadline for submitting any posters for the cultural festival.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.770
This is a reminder to any clubs who haven't submitted anything yet to do so.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.560
Here it is—the Sunflower Burger!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.380
Ooh, it looks delicious!

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.070
And it's so cute too!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:37.570
Your photo gave me the idea.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:43.960
It is almost 5 PM, the deadline for submitting posters.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.830
Oh no, what now?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.160
I'll photograph this!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.030
Hold the reflector board!

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:48.900
Okay!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.840
It's ready!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.260
We made it!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:08.980
But we haven't accomplished our goal yet.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.860
You're right.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:14.540
This club will disband if no new members join.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.360
Let's do our best!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:20.360
Kouga Academy Cultural Festival

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.680
Yunoki-san...

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:26.400
If everything goes well, could you come to the school courtyard after the festival?

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:27.870
I have something to tell you.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.460
Huh? Okay.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.650
"M-Magic Cafe"?

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:39.820
Maeda-kun.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.760
Y-Yunoki-san?!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.060
Why are you dressed like that?!

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:47.630
It was my idea!

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.560
Kanon! And Nonoka!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.870
Yo, Darts'un.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:54.940
We thought it might be tough for Rina-chi to run this all by herself, so we're helping out.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.150
Thank you both so much!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:09.530
Wh-What's the legendary cosplayer Alice-san doing here?

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.980
I'm here to help!

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:21.260
Oh, you must be—

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.870
Secret.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.030
All right, let's do this!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:28.740
Okay.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.980
Yeah!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.310
F-For real?

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:33.090
Yay!

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:37.820
The White Sister and Dark Sister have become friends!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.080
Maeda-kun!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.360
Listen! Listen!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:55.090
Something amazing just happened!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:59.490
Just now, some freshman girls
came and asked to join the club!

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:00.740
Five of them!

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.220
Huh? Really?!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.520
Yeah!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:07.070
They asked if the Sunflower Burger was something they could learn to make!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.230
That's great!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.200
Now the club won't be disbanded!

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.470
Yeah!

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:16.860
Just thinking that I was able to pass on the
Sunflower Burger recipe makes me so happy!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.040
And it's all thanks to you, Maeda-kun!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:26.670
No, it was all because of your hard work, Yunoki-san.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.290
I just helped.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.990
No, it wouldn't have happened without you!

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.840
Yunoki-san, I—

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.840
Maeda-kun, I—

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:41.260
I love you!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.380
H-Huh?!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:45.590
I guess...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.220
I'm not good enough.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.640
That's not it.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.890
I was surprised that you confessed out of the blue.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:57.180
I love you too, Yunoki-san.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:58.900
I called you out here to tell you that.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.950
I thought it was kinda obvious.

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:06.140
I-I suspected it, but...

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:07.920
I wanted to say it first.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:10.700
Ooh, I'm so sorry...

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.430
It's fine.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:15.100
That's what I love about you.

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:45.580
Hey...

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.180
Would you mind if we called each other like newlyweds again?

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:53.080
Dear.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:55.720
Rina.

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:16.500
Listen up, everyone!

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:18.190
Don't try to rush.

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:19.590
Just relax.

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:21.310
First, you take these and—

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:25.100
What are you doing, Senpai?!

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:27.740
Oh no! My green apples!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.820
Wait for me!

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:32.850
Geez, stop taking photos and help me!

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:36.580
No apple pie for you if you don't!

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:12.260
Impwossible!

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:17.020
How could I, a lifelong seeker of borderline eroticism, let the perfect photo subject escape my eye?!

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.220
Misumi Tomoe.

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:22.160
A pretty girl defined by her wispy figure and somber expression.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:24.980
Born on October 29th. Scorpio. Blood type AB.

00:24:25.650 --> 00:24:26.360
Maeda.

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:30.900
Capture every ounce of the eroticism that lies beneath her hesitant and reserved exterior!

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:32.360
Storm, blow forth!

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:33.920
Blouse, become translucent!

00:24:33.920 --> 00:24:36.860
Secret Bra Hunter!

00:24:36.860 --> 00:24:39.390
A photo opportunity. Forever.
